<title>FINLAND: Finnish March jobless rate falls to 17.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Finnish March jobless rate falls to 17.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's jobless rate fell to 17.3 percent in March from 17.8 percent in February, the Labour Ministry said in its monthly employment survey on Tuesday.</p>
<p>			Mar 1997    Feb 1997	Mar 1996</p>
<p>    Unemployed     424,100     437,600	 451,600</p>
<p>    Jobless rate    17.3	  17.8	    18.6</p>
<p>The ministry's data is not used in international comparisons.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
